From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: UnlimitedBytes <admin@unlimitedbytes.ovh>
Date: Fri, 2 Jan 2026 16:05:48 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Fix EntityList/ChunkEntitySlices concurrent access crash

Critical fix for ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException in Int2IntOpenHashMap:
- Add ReentrantReadWriteLock to ChunkEntitySlices for entity list operations
- Protect addEntity/removeEntity with write locks
- Protect iteration methods (save, unload, getAllEntities, etc.) with read locks

Fix moveEntity TOCTOU race condition:
- Add per-entity ReentrantLock (moonrise$getSectionLock) to ChunkSystemEntity
- Lock entity during section coordinate changes in EntityLookup.moveEntity
- Prevents race where multiple threads try to move same entity

